## 3. ESP32 — Main Robot Controller

The **ESP32** is the main controller of VORTEX 2.0.

It handles:

* Voice commands
* Motor movement
* Obstacle detection
* Temperature and humidity
* OLED display
* Audio feedback
* Wi-Fi communication
* Blynk communication

### Main Components Connected to ESP32

| Component     | Purpose                |
| ------------- | ---------------------- |
| VC-02         | Voice commands         |
| L298N         | Motor control          |
| HC-SR04       | Obstacle detection     |
| DHT22         | Temperature & humidity |
| OLED          | Display                |
| DFPlayer Mini | Audio feedback         |

---

## 4. ESP8266 — Appliance Controller

The **ESP8266 NodeMCU** is used for smart-home appliance control.

It receives commands from Blynk Cloud and controls a 4-channel relay.

```text
Blynk Cloud
     │
     ▼
  ESP8266
     │
     ▼
  4-CH Relay
     │
 ┌───┼──────────────┐
 ▼   ▼              ▼
Fan Light       Water Motor
                    │
                    ▼
                    TV
```

### Relay Assignment

| Relay   | Appliance   |
| ------- | ----------- |
| Relay 1 | Fan         |
| Relay 2 | Light       |
| Relay 3 | Water Motor |
| Relay 4 | TV          |

