## 5. Voice Command Flow

VORTEX uses predefined voice commands.

```text
User
 ↓
VC-02
 ↓
ESP32
 ↓
Command Processing
 ↓
Action
```

### Example

```text
"Forward"
    ↓
  VC-02
    ↓
  ESP32
    ↓
 L298N
    ↓
 Motors
    ↓
Robot moves forward
```

---

## 6. Appliance Control Flow

For home appliances, the command travels through Blynk Cloud.

```text
User
 ↓
Voice Command
 ↓
VC-02
 ↓
ESP32
 ↓
Blynk Cloud
 ↓
ESP8266
 ↓
Relay
 ↓
Appliance
```

### Example

```text
"Fan ON"
    ↓
  ESP32
    ↓
Blynk Cloud
    ↓
  ESP8266
    ↓
 Relay 1
    ↓
 Fan ON
```

